# Rusturf Tunnel: a tunnel dug by hand and given up halfway, a slow, echoing clarinet line in D minor over a
# patient pluck and a low hum, with the tap of a pick in the dark. A cave plays the same by day and night. Original
# composition for this game (plan 21 · H2, part b).
